OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry and mostly cloudy in the
OL,6,Fmorning and most of the afternoon with
OL,7,Fsome bright intervals. Rain arriving
OL,8,Finto the Western Isles during the
OL,9,Fafternoon, heavy at times. Strong
OL,10,Fsoutheasterly winds and gales
OL,11,Fdeveloping.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA dry start for eastern
OL,14,Fareas. Rain across the west pushes
OL,15,Feastwards through the evening, falling
OL,16,Fas snow on hills. Strong southeasterly
OL,17,Fwinds with severe gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
