OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FRain and hill snow to start.
OL,6,FThis clearing eastwards through the
OL,7,Fmorning, leading to bright spells and
OL,8,Fshowers during the afternoon. Winds
OL,9,Feasing.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,12,Fspells and a few showers possible on
OL,13,FSaturday. Heavy showers spreading east
OL,14,FSunday. Further rain and strong winds
OL,15,Farriving from the west on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
